OL,3,GNEWSAMultiple European flights face
OL,4,Abomb threats for second time this week
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral flights across Europe have
OL,7,Ffaced bomb threats, officials have
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FAn Aer Lingus Airbus A320 plane which
OL,11,Fdeparted Dublin on Thursday morning
OL,12,Fissued an emergency alert, diverted and
OL,13,Flanded at Evreux air base in northern
OL,14,FFrance.
OL,16,FMeanwhile, Finnish airline Finnair said
OL,17,Fthere was a bomb threat against one of
OL,18,Fits planes travelling from Helsinki to
OL,19,Fthe Italian capital on Thursday. It was
OL,20,Fescorted by air force jets and landed
OL,21,Fas scheduled.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
