OL,3,GNEWSAMultiple European flights face
OL,4,Abomb threats for second time this week
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes just days after eight European
OL,7,Fflights, including two departing from
OL,8,Fthe UK, were targeted by suspected bomb
OL,9,Fthreats. No explosives were found on
OL,10,Fany of the planes after searches.
